Preamble
The Swiss Federal Council,
on the basis of Article 101 paragraph 1 of the Nuclear Energy Act of 21 March 2003 (NEA),Articles 4, 11 and 22 paragraph 1 of the Goods Control Act of 13 December 1996 (GCA) and Articles 17 paragraph 2 and 47 paragraph 1 of the Radiological Protection Act of 22 March 1991 (RPA),
